From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement the x64 image base helpers and __p__mbcasemap.

The x64 image base helpers of the C++ exception code, _SetImageBase,
_GetImageBase, _SetThrowImageBase and _GetThrowImageBase (msvcr80 and
later, ucrtbase), kept per thread in the CRT thread data; and
__p__mbcasemap (msvcr80 and later), the case table of the current
multibyte code page beside __p__mbctype. msvcr120_app forwards.
